# Kitesail Larcenist: the chosen Ornithopter has "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color" (CR 613.1f, 605.1a): activating it taps and sacrifices it (it goes to Bot1's graveyard) for one blue mana, which a Treasure's ability may produce although the Ornithopter is colorless. Bot2's Llanowar Elves is a Treasure too and is no creature: with its mana ability gone it makes mana only by being sacrificed for any color (CR 111.10a) - red here, not the {G} of its own ability - and goes to Bot2's graveyard.

